ok   address classification
ok   URLs the client does not take, without repeating them
ok   URLs are split into host, port and request target
ok   headers the client owns or cannot send are refused
ok   timeouts must be positive
ok   https to a server that does not speak TLS fails the handshake
ok   a TLS handshake that gets no answer times out
